# A single quad, four vertices, no normals, no texcoords, no material.
# Included as the smallest possible end-to-end case: it still goes through
# groupToObj, convertToRenderable's triangulation fan, RawMesh's X-180 rotation,
# generateNormals and distinct.
v -0.5 0 -0.5
v  0.5 0 -0.5
v  0.5 0  0.5
v -0.5 0  0.5
f 1 2 3 4
